title: Sign-Based Lighting & Traffic Sign Deglare (SBLM & TSDG)
raw_community_title: Sign-Based Light Mode & Traffic Sign Deglare
category: Lighting
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: Lariat / Platinum / Flash (Matrix LED Headlamps)
source_sheet: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix LED & Euro Ranger Platinum Comparison + Livnitup
  Master Database
author: Kyle / AsBuiltPro
validated: false
status: unvalidated
notes: 'Enables two camera-driven road sign lighting features used on European Ford
  Matrix LED headlamps alongside the required IPMA camera sign-recognition feeds
  (MFCTSR & MFCTSRSY):

  (1) Sign-Based Light Mode (SBLM) uses the IPMA front camera to recognize approaching
  junctions, roundabouts, yield, and stop signs and pre-widens the headlight beam
  into the intersection.

  (2) Traffic Sign Deglare (TSDG) dims the specific Matrix high-beam LEDs shining
  directly onto highly reflective road signs so they do not dazzle the driver when
  Glare-Free High Beams are actively engaged.

  IMPORTANT — HCM CRC AUTO-CALCULATION: The 734-11-01 nibbles below are set to
  placeholders (0000 00) because the final 16-bit NL1B HCM CRC depends on all
  combined HCM modifications on the vehicle. AsBuiltPro automatically calculates
  and populates 734-11-01 from your vehicle''s final HCM configuration. If applying
  manually in FORScan, you must recalculate 734-11-01 using the NL1B HCM CRC
  calculator or the HCM will set U2100 / B104A.

  NOTE — 734-05-01 & 734-01-02: Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix leaves HCM 734-01-02 nibble
  1 (TSDGE) at 0 and sets 734-05-01 nibble 7 (SLME) to 1 (SLME Enable); if testing
  2 (SLME Traffic sign deglare ON) produces no SBLM intersection widening, test 1
  (or 3).'
steps:
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-01
  notes: 'Enables ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR (MFCTSR = SLIF): 0 -> 4 (Pro / XLT 311A without
    IACC) or 1 -> 5 (with IACC). Higher trims (XLT 312A / Flash / Lariat / Platinum)
    already have 5 (SLIF + IACC) from factory — leave as 5 and do NOT add +2.'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '4'
    offset_hint: '+4'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR (MFCTSR)
      target_state: MFCTSR SLIF
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR (MFCTSR)
      target_state: MFCTSR SLIF
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-01
  notes: 'Add +2 to existing nibble 3 value (e.g., 0 -> 2) to enable ModuleFeatureCfg_SBLM.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_SBLM (MFCSBLM)
      target_state: MFCSBLM Enabled
- module: IPMA
  address: 706-01-02
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing nibble 2 value (e.g., 0 -> 8) to enable Stop/Yield Sign
    Recognition in the IPMA.'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '8'
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: ModuleFeatureCfg_TSR_StopYield (MFCTSRSY)
      target_state: MFCTSRSY Enabled
- module: IPC
  address: 720-03-02
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing nibble 2 value (4 -> C across all Lightnings) to enable
    Traffic Sign Recognition in the IPC.'
  targets:
  - mask: xx*x xx--
    community_hex: C
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)
      target_state: TSR enabled
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-02
  notes: 'Add +8 to existing nibble 9 value (5 -> D on Pro / XLT 311A) to enable
    Traffic Sign Recognition toggle in SYNC 4. XLT 312A / Flash / Lariat / Platinum
    already have D from factory — leave as D.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx x*--
    community_hex: D
    offset_hint: '+8'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature_name: Traffic Sign Recognition (TSR)
      target_state: TSR Enabled
- module: HCM
  address: 734-01-02
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 1 to enable m2_TSDG_Enable (TSDGE Enable). Note:
    Euro Kuga Mk3.5 Matrix and Euro Ranger Platinum leave this at 0. Requires valid
    734-11-01 CRC.'
  targets:
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '1'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: m2_TSDG_Enable (TSDGE)
      target_state: TSDGE Enable
- module: HCM
  address: 734-05-01
  notes: 'Set to exact nibble value 2 (SLME Traffic sign deglare ON) or 1 (SLME Enable,
    matching Euro Kuga Matrix). Requires valid 734-11-01 CRC.'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxx* xx--
    community_hex: '2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: m2_SbLM_Enable (SLME)
      target_state: SLME Traffic sign deglare ON
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: m2_SbLM_Enable (SLME)
      target_state: SLME Traffic sign deglare ON
- module: HCM
  address: 734-11-01
  notes: 'PLACEHOLDER HCM calibration CRC & line checksum block (0000 00) —
    automatically calculated by AsBuiltPro from the final combined HCM
    configuration (or compute via the NL1B HCM CRC calculator before flashing).'
  targets:
  - mask: '*xxx xxxx xx--'
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xx*x xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxxx *xxx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
  - mask: xxxx x*xx xx--
    community_hex: '0'
    type: discrete
recipe_version: '1.1'
